@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Liberation Serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
hide empty members
participant "Composition root" as P0
participant "Repository" as P1
participant "WebhookService" as P2
participant "Docker" as P3
P0 -> P1: RecoverDestructions
P0 -> P2: Recover(ctx)
P2 -> P1: FindProvisioning
P1 -> P2: reservation dang dở
P2 -> P1: lookup PR theo key
P2 -> P2: pr.CommitHash = env.CommitSHA
P2 -> P3: Destroy(env.ID)
P2 -> P3: Provision đúng SHA [async]
P2 -> P1: lưu outcome qua completeProvision
@enduml